{"type":"standard","title":"John Cowan (Georgia politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">John Cowan (Georgia politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"titles":{"canonical":"John_Cowan_(Georgia_politician)","normalized":"John Cowan (Georgia politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">John Cowan (Georgia politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":83991414,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1383734101","tid":"18345477-d858-11f1-9933-7fef32b7bfe4","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:00:30Z","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Cowan_(Georgia_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Cowan_(Georgia_politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Cowan_(Georgia_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:John_Cowan_(Georgia_politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Cowan_(Georgia_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/John_Cowan_(Georgia_politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Cowan_(Georgia_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:John_Cowan_(Georgia_politician)"}},"extract":"John Alfred Cowan Jr. is an American politician and neurosurgeon. The Republican nominee for Georgia's 11th congressional district in the 2026 House elections. He was previously a candidate for the 14th district in the 2020 House elections, but lost the primary to Marjorie Taylor Greene.","extract_html":"<p><b>John Alfred Cowan Jr.</b> is an American politician and neurosurgeon. The Republican nominee for Georgia's 11th congressional district in the 2026 House elections. He was previously a candidate for the 14th district in the 2020 House elections, but lost the primary to Marjorie Taylor Greene.</p>"}